OL,3,ANHS Grampian publishes leaked report at
OL,4,Acentre of hospital scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS Grampian has published the internal
OL,7,Freport which revealed there had been 19
OL,8,Favoidable deaths of patients who had
OL,9,Fundergone liver and pancreatic surgery
OL,10,Fat Aberdeen Royal Infirmary.
OL,12,FIt was leaked last week by surgeon Dr
OL,13,FMohammed Habib, who called for NHS
OL,14,FGrampian to face a corporate homicide
OL,15,Fprobe after the report said some
OL,16,Fpatients bled to death on the operating
OL,17,Ftable.
OL,19,FNHS Grampian has now released the
OL,20,Freport from September 2022, along with
OL,21,Fa redacted version of a follow-up from
OL,22,FNovember the same year.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
